 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 531492,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A survey of college students asked how many courses those students were currently taking. Create a quantitative frequency distribution to summarize the raw data given below:\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr></tbody>\n</table>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Count the number of times you see each response.</p>\n<p>Step 2: Make a table with two columns. The first column should be labeled so that the reader knows what each response means. The second should be labeled “Frequency.” Then fill in the results of the count.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Classes</th>\n<th>Frequency</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Step 3. Check your work. If you add up the counts, it should be the same number as the total number of responses.</p>\n<p>1 + 3 + 16 + 8 + 4 = 32</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of classes</th>\n<th>Frequency</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr></tbody>\n</table>\n"
    }
   ],
